   Direct 1:1 reuploads without significant gameplay additions or overhauls are not allowed. Swapping a texture, tweaking UI values, or recompiling as-is does NOT count as a meaningful contribution. Do not pollute GameJolt or other platforms with zero-effort clones.

3. INDEPENDENT BACKEND & NO ORIGINAL API DAMAGE:
   You are strictly prohibited from connecting forks, decompiled builds, or mods to the original Fazbear Simulator GameJolt Game ID, DataStore keys, Leaderboards, or Discord webhooks. 
   You must plug in your own API keys, DataStore entries, and App IDs. Using this source code to reverse-engineer, cheat, exploit, flood, manipulate, or overwrite live player data of the original Fazbear Simulator game is strictly prohibited.

4. RESTRICTION ON GENERATIVE AI CONTENT:
   The inclusion or addition of generative AI artistic assets (including but not limited to AI-generated images, 2D art, textures, 3D models, or AI audio/voice synthesis) into derived builds is not permitted. AI-assisted programming is allowed, but not recommended without user's contribution.

